flick-tiler (1.10) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Turning tiling on tiles the windows already open (not minimized or
    fullscreen): each gets a region and, for that moment, a key of its
    own, which the daemon presses with wtype after focusing the window.
    A window whose key didn't run stays floating, and the notification
    says how many. Depends on wtype.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 19:49:36 +0800

